### 3. Backend REST APIs & Schemas Layer

#### [NEW] [backend/app/schemas/social.py](file:///c:/Users/DELL/OneDrive/Desktop/Perimeter/Perimeter---Women-Safety-Platform/backend/app/schemas/social.py)
- Pydantic models for user profile details, edit profile, follow actions, post comments, likes, shares, saves, story interactions, reels, direct messages, and broadcast channels.

#### [NEW] [backend/app/api/social.py](file:///c:/Users/DELL/OneDrive/Desktop/Perimeter/Perimeter---Women-Safety-Platform/backend/app/api/social.py)
- **Profile Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/me`: Full user profile with follower/following stats and activity counters.
  - `PUT /api/v1/social/profile/me`: Update bio, avatar, phone, location, private account setting.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/users/{user_id}/profile`: Public profile view for another user with follow relationship status.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/users/search`: Search users by name, username, role, or area.
- **Follow System Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/social/users/{user_id}/follow`: Follow / send follow request.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/users/{user_id}/unfollow`: Unfollow user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/users/{user_id}/followers`: List followers.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/users/{user_id}/following`: List following.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/follow-requests`: List pending requests for private accounts.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/follow-requests/{request_id}/respond`: Accept/reject request.
- **Activity & Profile History Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/my-posts`: Posts created by user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/my-liked-posts`: Posts liked by user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/my-commented-posts`: Posts commented on by user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/my-shared-posts`: Posts shared by user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/profile/my-cases`: Emergency SOS cases and incident reports filed by this user with live responder timeline.
- **Post Interactions Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/social/posts/{post_id}/like`: Toggle like/unlike with DB persistence.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/posts/{post_id}/comments`: Post a comment.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/posts/{post_id}/comments`: Get comments for a post.
  - `DELETE /api/v1/social/comments/{comment_id}`: Delete own comment.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/posts/{post_id}/share`: Record post share.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/posts/{post_id}/save`: Bookmark/save post.
- **Reels & Video Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/social/reels`: List reels feed with video URLs.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/reels`: Upload/publish a safety reel (up to 90s).
  - `POST /api/v1/social/reels/{reel_id}/like`: Like/unlike reel.
- **Direct Messages Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/social/conversations`: List active DM conversations.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/conversations`: Start or get conversation with another user.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/conversations/{conv_id}/messages`: Retrieve conversation message history.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/conversations/{conv_id}/messages`: Send text message.
- **Broadcast Channels Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/social/channels`: List public broadcast channels (Police, Press, Emergency).
  - `POST /api/v1/social/channels`: Create channel (for Police, Journalist, Admin).
  - `POST /api/v1/social/channels/{channel_id}/subscribe`: Subscribe/join channel.
  - `GET /api/v1/social/channels/{channel_id}/posts`: Retrieve channel broadcasts.
  - `POST /api/v1/social/channels/{channel_id}/posts`: Publish broadcast update.

